 "remarks": "Conveniently located in the heart of downtown, this spacious townhouse-style condo is within walking distance of the town center, train station, and park. The updated kitchen features granite countertops, a Sub-Zero refrigerator, and a Miele dishwasher. The open living and dining area leads directly to a lovely outdoor terrace and private, garden-style backyard-perfect for relaxing or entertaining. All bedrooms are located on the second floor, along with a full bathroom. The finished basement offers additional living space, a full bathroom, cedar closet, and laundry room. The property also includes an attached one-car garage plus two additional outdoor parking spaces. Living room opens directly to a lovely outdoor terrace and a private backyard with a small garden, creating a peaceful setting for relaxing or entertaining. Move-in ready condition.",
